values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'en', null, 'Chinese Culture & Civilization', 'A respectful tour of one of the world''s oldest continuous civilizations: its geography, its philosophies, its language and arts, its festivals and food, and its reach in the modern world. Topic coverage and structure are adapted from Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (CC BY-SA 4.0). All prose here is original, and names are given in pinyin.', null, 'foundations', 67, true, 'humanities', '{}')
